  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It takes the form of a paper crane and comes in light blue, dark green, pink, and several other colors.",
        "chapters": [
          278
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Shang Yan Fei’s messenger copy is bright red.",
        "chapters": [
          311
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_shang_yan_fei"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan bulk-buys the market form, rank two Paper Crane Gu, together with dog enslavement Gu and exploding egg Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          323
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_dog_enslavement_gu",
          "gu_exploding_egg_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Paper Crane Gu again carries the rank two label, along with the phrase “common rank two paper crane Gu.”",
        "chapters": [
          324
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Early chapters that show purchase, letter flight, and inheritance use do not state what Paper Crane Gu eats.",
        "chapters": [
          278
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is especially used to send letters.",
        "chapters": [
          278
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Shang clan practice, Shang Yan Fei wills a bright red Paper Crane Gu into a secret room as a letter to Ju Kai Bei and Yan Tu, and later sends another paper crane secret letter along a dark path the same way.",
        "chapters": [
          311
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shang_clan",
          "char_ju_kai_bei",
          "char_yan_tu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Owning Paper Crane Gu is also the entry key for King Xin Inheritance. Old Zhang states that to enter the blue pillar a Gu Master needs to have Paper Crane Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          324
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_king_xin_inheritance",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At the start of that inheritance, a Gu Master can use Paper Crane Gu while other Gu besides Spring Autumn Cicada are suppressed, and the activated crane floats ahead and leads the way.",
        "chapters": [
          346
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing scheme against Shang Ya Zi, Shang Yan Fei sends a bright red Paper Crane Gu as both punishment and a test, delivering orders to his hidden rank four pawns Ju Kai Bei and Yan Tu.",
        "chapters": [
          311
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "shang-yan-feis-messenger-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_shang_ya_zi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later sends another paper crane secret letter into the same secret room, telling Ju Kai Bei that if he wins he should seek Heavenly Essence Treasure Lotus and must not choose All-Out Effort Gu. Yan Tu analyzes that Shang Yan Fei wants to protect Fang Zheng’s growth.",
        "chapters": [
          315
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "shang-yan-feis-messenger-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_heavenly_essence_treasure_lotus",
          "gu_all_out_effort_gu",
          "char_fang_zheng"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
