  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan buys Paper Crane Gu from a shop in Shang clan city while refining, and feeds colored copies into Lion Roar Gu as part of making a temporary Eating One’s Words Gu. It comes in light blue, dark green, pink, and several other colors, and is especially used to send letters.",
        "chapters": [
          278
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "gu_eating_ones_words_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Once news of the Three Kings Inheritance breaks, Fang Yuan mass-purchases rank two Paper Crane Gu in Shang clan city as one of the three entry Gu, alongside dog enslavement Gu and exploding egg Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          323
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "three-kings-inheritance-key",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_three_kings_inheritance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "King Xin developed a unique set of Gu worms from the common rank two Paper Crane Gu, which let her get information easily and helped expose a Wu clan security loophole. Cited chapters do not name the later rank three lightning symbol paper crane Gu as one member of that set.",
        "chapters": [
          324
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "three-kings-inheritance-key",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_king_xin",
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "fac_wu_clan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On San Cha mountain, Fang Yuan activates Paper Crane Gu inside King Xin Inheritance; it floats ahead and leads him through grey fog while heavenly power suppresses his other Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          356
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "three-kings-inheritance-key",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Through a loophole, Fang Yuan receives three letter path Gu worms. One has a paper crane appearance and is named rank three lightning symbol paper crane Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          418
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "related-letter-gu-and-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Lord Sky Crane later orders that Gu sent through a loophole because it is fast as lightning.",
        "chapters": [
          419
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "related-letter-gu-and-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lord_sky_crane"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hu Immortal blessed land sits on Tian Ti mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          388
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "related-letter-gu-and-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
          "loc_tian_ti"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Zheng later sends that Gu into the blessed land; Fang Yuan refines and returns it with a trade list.",
        "chapters": [
          419
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "related-letter-gu-and-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The text names that Gu separately from the common rank two Paper Crane Gu, and it never states that lightning symbol paper crane Gu is one of King Xin’s unique developments from the common form.",
        "chapters": [
          324
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "related-letter-gu-and-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Much later, paper crane Gu joins the Gu used for transmitting information in information path cultivation, beside goose Gu, butterfly letter Gu, flying sword letter Gu, and messenger dove Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2023
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "related-letter-gu-and-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
